{"version":1,"content":"<p>京都有兩間主打薪火料理的米芝蓮一星食府，備受食客注目。</p><p>其中一間結合薪火、發酵技術與世界各地的飲食文化，創作風格鮮明的創意料理；</p><p>另一間則將傳統法式烹調融入薪火技藝，呈現細膩的味覺享受。</p><p>香港亦有餐廳以柴火入饌，讓客人感受箇中獨特「味」力。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T10:18:58.126196+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T10:00:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T10:12:47.830654+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T10:12:47.830654+00:00","content_hash":"6342b8a6095c0bb010be16adda523433e167726aa70094bb02a7da47ea6514fc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}